OL,3,ADavid Walliams named as celebrity who
OL,4,Atried to block publication of sexual
OL,5,Amisconduct allegations
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne girl told the publication she was
OL,8,F15 when Williams first contacted her,
OL,9,Fand by the time she was 17 they were
OL,10,Fhaving sex - he strongly denies he
OL,11,Fgroomed the woman
OL,13,FHe had asked the High Court to block
OL,14,Fthe publication of the investigation,
OL,15,Fwith his lawyers arguing if the
OL,16,Fallegations were made public he would
OL,17,Fkill himself
OL,19,FThe court refused the request, saying
OL,20,Fthe risks could be mitigated and that
OL,21,Fit was not the court's responsibility
OL,22,Fto protect his wellbeing
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
